{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Park It!</strong> is a grid-based puzzle game where players park cars in designated spots across 78 levels. Designed for all skill levels, each level challenges your thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>78 Engaging Levels: Navigate increasingly intricate parking scenarios that require careful planning and accurate movements.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAR-INSPIRED MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider the direction of the vehicle before parking. Optimise your moves with side turns. This highlights the engaging puzzle aspect that encourages players to think about the parking challenge.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989830/extras/b9208a2512c537fe5179b0670e096ef5.poster.avif?t=1753714829\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989830/extras/b9208a2512c537fe5179b0670e096ef5.webm?t=1753714829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989830/extras/b9208a2512c537fe5179b0670e096ef5.mp4?t=1753714829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you park perfectly without running out of gas?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I Park.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2989830/e0af520905b70dddaa368506a9e2b0128deb3eb9.jpg"},{"name":"Beachy.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2989830/350cba83ea858ec04c43ed3be77ca6be65b36883.jpg"},{"name":"Disaster Cat.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/st